{"3898290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Fame Game: Welcome to Hollywood", "steam_appid": 3898290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/23c37e06535aa62cc8832a2c995f7639.poster.avif?t=1778097433\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/23c37e06535aa62cc8832a2c995f7639.webm?t=1778097433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/23c37e06535aa62cc8832a2c995f7639.mp4?t=1778097433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/eb23271b57ecf1cd10a92b6561b5fdf1.avif?t=1778097433\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“The Fame Game” is an exciting full-motion interactive game, packed with intricate mechanics, hours of gameplay, hundreds of choices, and countless varied endings. You will climb the ranks of Hollywood stardom, gain A-list status, nab a leading role on the hottest TV show, and fall in love with seven unique beauties on set. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find your own Hollywood romance and become a certified star? Or will your 15 minutes of fame fizzle out? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/a652e36e9319f979a056d36db7a184d6.avif?t=1778097433\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the famed A-list couple at the center of television’s biggest soap opera breaks up, you go from ordinary “extra” to “leading man” in an instant! As you strive to make it in Hollywood, you encounter the glamorous series star, the imaginative writer, the dominant producer, the kind caterer, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive all that Hollywood dishes out and nab your very own leading lady?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will you choose…? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/5b1259ff068191d43178ac6ff4aab0c9.avif?t=1778097433\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it the sexy, confident, celebrity bombshell? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/1a46ca376d91f47e5a9d82721179c34a.poster.avif?t=1778097433\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/1a46ca376d91f47e5a9d82721179c34a.webm?t=1778097433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/1a46ca376d91f47e5a9d82721179c34a.mp4?t=1778097433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it the bubbly and creative risk-taker with a beautiful smile? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/af9ebf7a408db4d9fad77c0aadb41a5f.poster.avif?t=1778097433\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/af9ebf7a408db4d9fad77c0aadb41a5f.webm?t=1778097433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/af9ebf7a408db4d9fad77c0aadb41a5f.mp4?t=1778097433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it the dominant girl boss not afraid to put you in your place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/2fa5fd963da82f654fa56bb0a0d2ebaf.poster.avif?t=1778097433\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/2fa5fd963da82f654fa56bb0a0d2ebaf.webm?t=1778097433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/2fa5fd963da82f654fa56bb0a0d2ebaf.mp4?t=1778097433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it the loyal best friend and ultimate girl next door? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/c44585f2d349070248562830b6dee46c.poster.avif?t=1778097433\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/c44585f2d349070248562830b6dee46c.webm?t=1778097433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/c44585f2d349070248562830b6dee46c.mp4?t=1778097433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898290/extras/2f6